#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:3
msgid "Importers, applications and simulations"
msgstr "导入器、应用程序与仿真"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:9
msgid "Importers"
msgstr "导入器"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:11
msgid ""
"``urdf``, ``sim-mujoco:mjcf`` and ``sim-gazebo:world`` are not object types "
"PartCAD hard-codes. Each is one entry of an ``import:`` section -- a "
"declaration saying which script reads that format, what its sandbox needs, "
"and which object kinds it may produce -- and a package writes one to teach "
"PartCAD a format of its own. That is not a hypothetical: ``urdf`` is the "
"only one of the three PartCAD ships, and the other two are entries of "
"exactly this kind in the plugin package for their engine."
msgstr ""
"``urdf``、 ``sim-mujoco:mjcf`` 和 ``sim-gazebo:world`` 并不是 PartCAD 硬编码"
"的对象类型。它们各自都是 ``import:`` 小节中的一个条目——一条声明，说明哪个脚本读取该格式、它的沙箱需要什么、以及它可以产生"
"哪些对象种类——包只要写下一个这样的条目，就能把自己的格式教给 PartCAD。这并非假设：这三者之中 PartCAD 只自带 ``ur"
"df``，另外两个正是各自引擎的插件包里这种类型的条目。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:34
msgid ""
"An object then names it the way it names any object type. A reader in the "
"same package is named directly; one in another package is named by full "
"path, exactly as a :ref:`partType <part-types>` or a ``simulation:`` plugin "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"此后对象就像指名任何对象类型那样指名它。同一个包中的读取器直接指名；位于另一个包中的则用完整路径指名，与 :ref:`partType "
"<part-types>` 或 ``simulation:`` 插件完全一样："

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:45
msgid ""
"The reader itself is handed the file and its parameters, and returns a tree "
"of placed shapes as plain data -- each node naming the *file* its geometry "
"is read from rather than carrying geometry. The part factory for that file's "
"own format reads it afterwards, so a mesh a scene references is never copied "
"or rewritten. Only the primitives a format defines (a box, a cylinder, a "
"sphere) have no file to name, and the reader writes those out itself. See "
"``wrappers/wrapper_import.py`` for the contract in full."
msgstr ""
"读取器本身拿到的是文件及其参数，返回的则是一棵已摆放形状的树，以纯数据表示——每个节点指明其几何读自哪个 *文件*，而不是直接携带几何。"
"随后由该文件自身格式的零件工厂去读取它，因此场景引用的网格永远不会被复制或改写。只有格式自身定义的基本体（长方体、圆柱、球）没有文件可供"
"指明，这些由读取器自己写出。完整的约定见 ``wrappers/wrapper_import.py``。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:53
msgid ""
"Two fields are worth dwelling on. ``kinds:`` is a claim the core holds the "
"declaration to: a format that describes one robot is an assembly and "
"declaring it under ``scenes:`` is an error, while a format used for both -- "
"MJCF is the one that routinely is -- says both and lets the section decide. "
"``dropped:`` words what the reader counted: every one of these formats "
"describes something a static tree cannot hold, and the division of labour is "
"that the *reader* counts what it had to drop and the *declaration* says what "
"to call it."
msgstr ""
"有两个字段值得细说。``kinds:`` 是核心会据以约束该声明的一项主张：描述单个机器人的格式是装配体，把它声明在 ``scenes:"
"`` 下就是错误；而两者兼用的格式——MJCF 就经常如此——则两种都写上，交由小节来决定。``dropped:`` 为读取器所统计的东"
"西提供措辞：这些格式无一例外都描述了静态树容纳不下的内容，而分工是：由 *读取器* 统计它不得不丢弃了什么，由 *声明* 来说明该怎么称呼它。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:61
msgid ""
"The section shares its name with what ``dependencies:`` used to be called, "
"and that spelling is reported rather than silently migrated now: a package "
"whose ``import:`` entries carry a ``type:`` of ``git``/``tar``/``local``/"
"``external``, or any of the transport-only keys (``url``, ``relPath``, "
"``revision``, ...), is told to rename the section, and those entries are "
"dropped instead of being fetched as packages. Nothing is migrated for it."
msgstr ""
"这个小节的名字与 ``dependencies:`` 过去的叫法相同，而如今这种写法会被报告出来，而不是被悄悄迁移：如果某个包的 ``i"
"mport:`` 条目带有 ``git`` / ``tar`` / ``local`` / ``external`` 之类的 ``typ"
"e:``，或者带有任何仅用于传输的键（``url``、 ``relPath``、 ``revision`` 等），它会被提示重命名该小节"
"，而这些条目会被丢弃，不再作为包去获取。不会为它迁移任何东西。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:68
msgid ""
"How loudly depends on whose package it is. In the package you are standing "
"in it is an error and the package is broken -- the command exits non-zero "
"and nothing loads out of it, because that is the file you can fix. In an "
"imported package it is a warning naming the package, the entry and the fix: "
"such a package is very often somebody else's, several levels below anything "
"you wrote, and one of them anywhere in an index must not fail every command "
"that merely walks past it. That package goes on providing everything else it "
"declares; what is lost is exactly what the section named."
msgstr ""
"提示有多严厉取决于那是谁的包。在你所处的包里，这是一个错误，而且包是坏的——命令以非零状态退出，不会从中加载任何东西，因为那正是你能修改"
"的文件。在导入的包里，这是一条警告，指出包、条目和修复办法：这类包往往是别人的，位于你所写内容之下好几层，而索引中任何一处出现这种情况，"
"都不应该让每一条仅仅路过它的命令失败。那个包会继续提供它声明的其余一切；丢失的恰好就是那个小节所指明的内容。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:77
msgid ""
"PartCAD ships **one** of these, in ``//builtin/import``: ``urdf``, which "
"stays there because a URDF describes a robot rather than any one engine's "
"world, and ROS, MuJoCo, PyBullet and Isaac all read it. ``mjcf`` and "
"``world`` belong to `partcad-sim-mujoco <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-"
"sim-mujoco>`_ and `partcad-sim-gazebo <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-"
"sim-gazebo>`_ respectively, beside the exporter and the simulator that share "
"their knowledge of the format: reading a format and writing it are one piece "
"of knowledge, and this is what lets the pair travel together and be "
"versioned together."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD 只自带其中 **一个**，位于 ``//builtin/import`` 中：``urdf``。它留在那里，是因为 UR"
"DF 描述的是机器人而不是某一个引擎的世界，而 ROS、MuJoCo、PyBullet 和 Isaac 都会读取它。``mjcf`` 和"
" ``world`` 则分别属于 `partcad-sim-mujoco <https://github.com/partcad/par"
"tcad-sim-mujoco>`_ 和 `partcad-sim-gazebo <https://github.com/partcad"
"/partcad-sim-gazebo>`_，与同样掌握该格式知识的导出器和仿真器放在一起：读取一种格式和写出这种格式是同一份知识，这正"
"是让这一对能够结伴同行、一同版本化的原因。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:86
msgid ""
"Each of those packages declares the reader, the writer, the simulator and "
"the ``open:`` entry for its format, and the wheel carries none of them. So "
"``type: sim-gazebo:world`` and ``type: sim-mujoco:mjcf`` are the spellings "
"that resolve, in a package that imports the plugin; a bare ``type: world`` "
"resolves to nothing and says which package to name."
msgstr ""
"这些包各自为自己的格式声明读取器、写入器、仿真器以及 ``open:`` 条目，而 wheel 中一个都不包含。因此，在导入了相应插件的"
"包里，能够解析的写法是 ``type: sim-gazebo:world`` 和 ``type: sim-mujoco:mjcf``；裸"
"写的 ``type: world`` 解析不到任何东西，并会提示应当指名哪个包。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:96
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "应用程序"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:98
msgid ""
"``pc ide open`` launches a third-party application on the file it is "
"given. Which applications it knows is an ``open:`` section -- one entry "
"per application, and data all the way down: where the application is on "
"each operating system, what to run it as, which container to fall back to"
" when it is not installed, and what it can read. None of it is logic. "
"Finding the binary, creating the container, forwarding the X display and "
"converting a file the application cannot read is the same for every tool "
"and happens once, in ``partcad_client.external``."
msgstr ""
"``pc ide open`` 会针对交给它的文件启动一个第三方应用程序。它认识哪些应用程序，由一个 ``open:`` "
"小节来决定——每个应用程序一个条目，而且自上而下全是数据：应用程序在每种操作系统上位于何处、以什么方式运行它、它没有安装时回退到哪个容器，以及它能读什么。其中没有任何逻辑。查找可执行文件、创建容器、转发"
" X 显示，以及转换应用程序读不了的文件，对每个工具都是一样的，并且只在 ``partcad_client.external`` 中实现一次。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:119
msgid ""
"``pc ide open --with democad ./cell.demo`` then works, in a workspace "
"whose packages import that one. PartCAD ships three of these in "
"``//builtin/open`` -- FreeCAD, KiCad and Blender. A package's entry "
"replaces a built-in of the same name, which is how the plugin for a "
"simulation engine comes to own the application for it: both `partcad-sim-"
"gazebo <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-sim-gazebo>`_ and `partcad-"
"sim-mujoco <https://github.com/partcad/partcad-sim-mujoco>`_ declare "
"theirs, so a workspace that imports either already gets the entry from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"这样，在其各个包导入了该包的工作区中，``pc ide open --with democad ./cell.demo`` "
"就能工作。PartCAD 在 ``//builtin/open`` 中自带三个这样的条目——FreeCAD、KiCad 和 "
"Blender。包中的条目会替换同名的内置条目，仿真引擎的插件正是这样接管了对应的应用程序：`partcad-sim-gazebo "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad-sim-gazebo>`_ 和 `partcad-sim-mujoco "
"<https://github.com/partcad/partcad-sim-mujoco>`_ "
"都声明了自己的条目，因此导入了其中任何一个的工作区，已经从那里获得了该条目。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:127
msgid ""
"``formats:`` is the one that decides most: what the application opens, "
"**best first** -- its own formats (``fcstd``, ``blend``, ``kicad_pcb``) "
"and PartCAD's part types (``step``, ``stl``). An object in one of them is"
" handed over as it is. Any other is converted to the first one on the "
"list that PartCAD can write, and ``pc ide open`` then waits for the "
"application to close: when the converted copy was changed, it is "
"converted back into the object's own format and written over its source, "
"where that source is a file (a STEP, an STL...) rather than a script."
msgstr ""
"``formats:`` "
"起的作用最大：应用程序能打开什么，**最佳的排在前面**——它自己的格式（``fcstd``、``blend``、``kicad_pcb``）以及"
" PartCAD 的零件类型（``step``、``stl``）。属于其中之一的对象按原样交出。其他对象会转换为列表中 PartCAD "
"能写出的第一种格式，然后 ``pc ide open`` "
"等待应用程序关闭：如果转换后的副本被修改了，就把它转换回对象自己的格式并覆盖其来源——前提是来源是文件（STEP、STL 等），而不是脚本。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:135
msgid ""
"Two more are how an application that cannot read what it was handed still"
" gets to open something. ``companions:`` names the extensions the "
"application really opens, for a file that sits beside the one PartCAD was"
" pointed at -- a ``kicad`` part *is* the STEP file KiCad's CLI writes, "
"and the board is the project next to it. ``sceneType:`` says which "
"description language an application reads, for one that reads an "
"arrangement rather than geometry: MuJoCo reads MJCF, so a Gazebo world it"
" is pointed at is written out as MJCF first."
msgstr ""
"另外两个字段，决定了一个读不懂所交给它的内容的应用程序怎样仍能打开点什么。``companions:`` 列出应用程序真正能打开的扩展名，用于与 "
"PartCAD 所指向文件并排存放的文件——``kicad`` 零件*本身就是* KiCad 的 CLI 写出的 STEP "
"文件，而电路板是旁边的那个工程。``sceneType:`` 说明应用程序读取哪种描述语言，适用于读取布局而不是几何体的应用程序：MuJoCo "
"读取 MJCF，所以指向它的 Gazebo 世界会先被写成 MJCF。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:143
msgid ""
"``container:`` has the shape a plugin's implementation gives it -- "
"``image``, and ``python`` for an image whose ``python3`` is not on "
"``PATH`` -- and the container is started the way every other PartCAD "
"container is (see :ref:`useDockerRemote <use-docker-remote>`), with the "
"file mounted or, under ``useDockerRemote``, uploaded. ``image:``, "
"``ownFormats:``, ``meshVia:`` and ``imports:`` are what an entry said "
"before ``container:`` and ``formats:``; they are still read, into those, "
"and ``pc ide open`` says once that they are deprecated."
msgstr ""
"``container:`` 的形式与插件实现中的相同——``image``，以及当镜像的 ``python3`` 不在 ``PATH`` "
"上时使用的 ``python``——容器的启动方式与 PartCAD 的其他容器一样（参见 :ref:`useDockerRemote <use-"
"docker-remote>`），文件以挂载方式提供，或者在 ``useDockerRemote`` "
"下以上传方式提供。``image:``、``ownFormats:``、``meshVia:`` 和 ``imports:`` 是在有 "
"``container:`` 和 ``formats:`` 之前条目的写法；它们仍会被读取并转换为后者，``pc ide open`` "
"会提示一次它们已被弃用。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:151
msgid ""
"``pc ide open`` is otherwise a **client-side** command and stays one: it "
"is handed a path, the file is already on disk, and the window belongs to "
"whoever ran the command -- a daemon can be remote. So the built-in "
"entries are read straight out of the wheel the client is running from, "
"with no context and no daemon, and only the applications a *package* "
"declares are asked of the daemon (``open.tools``). It answers which "
"applications exist; it never opens one, and there is no method for "
"opening a file."
msgstr ""
"除此之外，``pc ide open`` 是一条 **客户端** "
"命令，而且会一直如此：交给它的是一个路径，文件已经在磁盘上，而窗口属于运行该命令的人——守护进程则可能在远端。因此内置条目直接从客户端所运行的 "
"wheel 中读取，既不需要上下文也不需要守护进程；只有 *包* "
"所声明的应用程序才会去问守护进程（``open.tools``）。它回答存在哪些应用程序；它从不打开应用程序，也没有用于打开文件的方法。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:163
msgid "Simulations"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:165
msgid ""
"A part says what it *is*. ``simulate:`` is an optional section of a part or "
"an assembly where it says what it is supposed to **do** once it is placed in "
"a world and the world is switched on -- or, more often, what it is supposed "
"not to do: not fall over, not slide off, not come apart. ``pc sim`` runs "
"them."
msgstr ""
"零件说明自己 *是什么*。``simulate:`` 是零件或装配体的一个可选小节，在那里它说明一旦被放进一个世界、而这个世界被启动之后"
"，它应当 **做什么**——或者更常见的是，它不应当做什么：不翻倒、不滑落、不散架。运行它们的是 ``pc sim``。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:183
msgid ""
"The object's own full path is assigned to the scene's ``subject`` parameter "
"-- unconditionally, and whatever else the entry says. That is what lets one "
"scene serve every object that names it, and nothing special is declared for "
"it: a simulation scene is an ordinary scene with an ordinary parameter, and "
"the Jinja2 template its file is read as (see :doc:`assy`) is what places the "
"subject."
msgstr ""
"对象自身的完整路径会被赋给场景的 ``subject`` 参数——无条件地赋值，无论该条目还说了什么。正是这一点让一个场景可以服务于指名"
"它的每一个对象，而且为此不需要声明任何特殊的东西：仿真场景就是一个带有普通参数的普通场景，而把被测对象摆放到位的，是它的文件被当作 Ji"
"nja2 模板读取时的那套模板（见 :doc:`assy`）。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:189
msgid ""
"``scene:`` does not have to be given: the default is ``//builtin/scene:"
"subject``, an empty world holding the subject and nothing else, which is "
"what \"does this stand up on its own\" means. ``simulation:`` does have to "
"be given -- PartCAD implements no simulator, so a package imports one and "
"says which:"
msgstr ""
"``scene:`` 不是必须给出的：默认是 ``//builtin/scene:subject``，一个只装着被测对象、别无他物的空世"
"界，这正是“这东西能不能自己立住”的含义。``simulation:`` 则必须给出——PartCAD 没有实现任何仿真器，所以包要导入"
"一个并说明用的是哪一个："

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:216
msgid ""
"``offset:`` is stated here rather than in the scene because it is a fact "
"about *this* object -- where its origin sits relative to the floor it is "
"meant to stand on -- and the scene is shared."
msgstr ""
"``offset:`` 写在这里而不是写在场景里，因为它是关于 *这个* 对象的事实——它的原点相对于它要立在其上的地面处于什么位置——"
"而场景是共享的。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:220
msgid ""
"``validation:`` is a Python expression evaluated over ``before`` and "
"``after``, the two objects the plugin produced, and ``result``, the whole of "
"what it returned. It is the only thing PartCAD reads out of a result: what "
"is *inside* those objects is the plugin's vocabulary, and the expression is "
"written by whoever knows both the object and the plugin. An entry that "
"states none runs and reports, and passes nothing."
msgstr ""
"``validation:`` 是一个 Python 表达式，在 ``before`` 和 ``after`` （插件产生的那两个对象）"
"以及 ``result`` （它返回的全部内容）之上求值。它是 PartCAD 唯一会从结果中读取的东西：这些对象 *内部* 的内容属于"
"插件自己的词汇，而表达式由同时了解该对象和该插件的人来写。没有给出表达式的条目会运行并报告，但不会通过任何检查。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:228
msgid "Simulation plugins"
msgstr "仿真插件"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:230
msgid ""
"A simulation plugin is the third kind of implementation a package can "
"declare, beside the export and render ones of :ref:`output-files`, and it is "
"declared in exactly the same form -- a ``path`` to a script, the sandbox "
"that script needs, and the parameters it is handed:"
msgstr ""
"仿真插件是包可以声明的第三类实现，另外两类是 :ref:`output-files` 中的导出实现和渲染实现；它的声明形式与那两类完全相"
"同——指向脚本的 ``path``、该脚本所需的沙箱，以及交给它的参数："

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:248
msgid ""
"The contract is narrow on purpose: **a scene with the subject in it goes in, "
"as a file in the format** ``format:`` **names, and JSON carrying** "
"``before`` **and** ``after`` **comes out.** The scene arrives as a file "
"because a simulator reads its own model format and PartCAD already knows how "
"to write several -- which is also what keeps a plugin free of any CAD "
"dependency."
msgstr ""
"这份约定是有意定得很窄的：**进去的是一个装有被测对象的场景，以** ``format:`` **所指明格式的文件形式进入；出来的是带有"
"** ``before`` **和** ``after`` **的 JSON。** 场景以文件形式送达，是因为仿真器读的是它自己的模型格"
"式，而 PartCAD 已经知道如何写出好几种——这也正是插件得以不依赖任何 CAD 的原因。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:254
msgid ""
"**PartCAD ships none of these.** A simulator is somebody's program with a "
"release cycle of its own, so PartCAD ships the concept -- this section, the "
"sandbox a plugin runs in, and the export a scene reaches it through -- and a "
"package supplies the physics. `partcad-sim-mujoco <https://github.com/"
"partcad/partcad-sim-mujoco>`_ is the MuJoCo one: it is handed the scene as "
"MJCF, steps it under gravity for ``duration`` seconds of simulated time, and "
"reports each body's position (in millimetres) and orientation before and "
"after. Running it needs no MuJoCo on the machine, since the plugin runs in a "
"PartCAD sandbox that installs one."
msgstr ""
"**PartCAD 一个都不自带。** 仿真器是别人的程序，有自己的发布周期，所以 PartCAD 提供的是这套概念——本小节、插件运行"
"其中的沙箱，以及场景借以送达插件的那次导出——而物理由包来提供。`partcad-sim-mujoco <https://github."
"com/partcad/partcad-sim-mujoco>`_ 就是对应 MuJoCo 的那个：它拿到以 MJCF 表示的场景，在重"
"力下推进 ``duration`` 秒的仿真时间，并报告每个物体在前后的位置（以毫米计）和姿态。运行它不需要机器上装有 MuJoCo，因"
"为插件运行在一个会自行安装 MuJoCo 的 PartCAD 沙箱中。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:265
msgid "Friction is a material property"
msgstr "摩擦是材料的属性"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:267
msgid ""
"Whether a stack of blocks stands up is not a property of its geometry. Two "
"20 mm blocks squarely stacked stay put when they are aluminium (``mu: 1.05`` "
"-- dry aluminium galls) and the top one slides off when they are PTFE (``mu: "
"0.04``), and nothing about the arrangement changes in between."
msgstr ""
"一摞方块能不能立住，并不是它几何的属性。两个 20 mm 的方块端正地摞在一起：如果是铝（``mu: 1.05`` ——干燥的铝会咬合）"
"，它们纹丝不动；如果是聚四氟乙烯（``mu: 0.04``），上面那个就会滑落；而这两种情形之间，布置方式没有任何变化。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:272
msgid ""
"So it is stated where it belongs, on the :ref:`material <materials>`, and a "
"part that names one gets it. A part names one the way it always has -- with "
"the ``material`` parameter, on a part type that accepts one (see :ref:"
"`parameters`) -- and the factory records the answer as the shape's "
"``material`` property, which is what reads it from there on:"
msgstr ""
"所以它被写在它该在的地方，即 :ref:`材料 <materials>` 上，而指名了某种材料的零件就会获得它。零件指名材料的方式一如既"
"往——在接受该参数的零件类型上使用 ``material`` 参数（见 :ref:`parameters`）——而工厂会把这个结果记录为"
"形状的 ``material`` 属性，此后读取它的正是这个属性："

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:289
msgid ""
"``mu`` then becomes the shape's ``friction`` property unless the shape "
"states a ``friction`` of its own, and every format writes it in its own "
"spelling -- SDFormat's ``<friction><ode><mu>``, URDF's ``<gazebo><mu1>``, "
"MJCF's first ``friction`` component. A part that says nothing gets whatever "
"the simulator defaults to, which is a number nobody chose."
msgstr ""
"除非形状自己给出了 ``friction``，否则 ``mu`` 随后会成为该形状的 ``friction`` 属性，而每种格式都用自己"
"的写法把它写出来——SDFormat 的 ``<friction><ode><mu>``、URDF 的 ``<gazebo><mu1>`"
"`、MJCF 的第一个 ``friction`` 分量。什么都没有说明的零件，拿到的是仿真器的默认值，那是一个谁也没有选过的数字。"

#: ../../source/config_plugins.rst:295
msgid ""
"Note which section that is. ``parameters:`` is what is *asked of* the type "
"that produces the shape and is where a package writes what it wants; "
"``properties:`` is what the shape *turned out to be*, and is filled in by "
"whatever built it -- a URDF reader naming a link's material, a STEP reader "
"finding one in the file, or the part factory recording what its type was "
"asked for. A package does not write ``properties:`` by hand."
msgstr ""
"请注意这指的是哪个小节。``parameters:`` 是 *向* 产生该形状的类型 *提出的要求*，是包写下自己想要什么的地方；``p"
"roperties:`` 则是形状 *最终成了什么样*，由构建它的东西填入——URDF 读取器指明某个连杆的材料，STEP 读取器在文件"
"中找到材料，或者零件工厂记录下它的类型被要求了什么。包不会手工书写 ``properties:``。"

